// Standalone Mechanics demo without the music/GUI overlay.
// Adam: A/D, left Shift/Ctrl, Space. Eve: arrows, right Shift/Ctrl, Enter.
Run Setup/Config
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Mechanics
Run Examples/Graphics/Character_Animation_Controls
Graphics Add_Window Main "Adam and Eve - GAME focus (F1 / Back: GUI)" 800 600
Graphics Set_FPS 60
Graphics Set_GUI_Visible False
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Characters
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Input

Graphics Window_Open Main
Set_Var_Global Character_Window_Open Graphics.Window.Main.Open
Loop While Var Character_Window_Open == 1
{
    Input Update Default
    Call Character_Check_Focus
    Call Adam_Read_Input
    Call Eve_Read_Input
    Call Character_Mechanics_Update
    Call Adam_Draw_Mechanics
    Call Eve_Draw_Mechanics
    Graphics Render
    Graphics Update
    Graphics Window_Open Main
    Set_Var_Global Character_Window_Open Graphics.Window.Main.Open
}
Mechanics Release Adam
Mechanics Release Eve
Input Close_Controller -1
Graphics Close_All
